[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8761.63, "timestamp": "02:26:01", "text": "天空弧系統已趨於穩定。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8766.23, "timestamp": "02:26:06", "text": "多年前，他從救援裝置中醒來。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8768.389, "timestamp": "02:26:08", "text": "不久前，這間小木屋被一場空洞風暴覆蓋了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8772.67, "timestamp": "02:26:12", "text": "正在進行中。尼奧，那個指揮官也發生了變異。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8774.429, "timestamp": "02:26:14", "text": "我甚至失去了理智。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8811.75, "timestamp": "02:26:51", "text": "看看它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8812.75, "timestamp": "02:26:52", "text": "一個，"}]